    "detailed_description": "Games of scientific discovery are akin to detective games. Uncovering hidden connections and subtle patterns is like untangling a web of meanings, studying causes, and predicting effects. By skillfully combining blocks of information and vectors of relationships, one can reach the truth. However, the truth will greatly surprise those who find it\u2014with its unexpected answer to the cause behind everything that happens.<br><br>INVESTIGATE A DETECTIVE STORY<br>Discover clues left in the sci-fi environment\u2014blocks of information. Combine them correctly and restore connections to progress in your investigation.<br><br>LEARN THE COST OF KNOWLEDGE<br>We\u2019re not saying ignorance is bliss, but\u2026 you can\u2019t play God and then pretend it was just a joke. Such a game doesn\u2019t come without consequences.<br><br>TRUST YOUR INTUITION<br>To fully unlock your potential, we\u2019ve curated a special soundtrack. Let go of your doubts and allow the music to guide you to the truth.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002040/extras/c9bf5d4555d2162e1877f8c2b996668d.avif?t=1747064743\" data-has-big width=800 height=342 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002040/extras/cb1793558a916880f6f4b9b6b63fa48c.avif?t=1747064743\" data-has-big width=800 height=342 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002040/extras/f3c55e271f7a543e3d74264c7b654d04.avif?t=1747064743\" data-has-big width=800 height=342 /></span>",
